    "soft_tissue_sarcoma"
  ],
  "description": "In this study, a cohort of 51 patients with histologically proven soft-tissue sarcomas (STSs) of the extremities was retrospectively evaluated. During the follow-up period, 19 patients developed lung metastases. Patients with metastatic and/or recurrent STSs at presentation were excluded from the study. All patients had pre-treatment FDG-PET/CT and MRI scans. Please see the Soft Tissue Sarcoma page to learn more about the images and to obtain any supporting metadata for this collection.",
